{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:35 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:15 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:15 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"寶馬司機棄車逃去，車內藏近百粒檢依托咪酯。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/fa419f8b5f35a544891ec504a8bb4c12/2026-11/page_104.jpg\"/><p>警方在黃大仙截獲毒品快餐車。今日（ 11日）中午11時58分，一輛白色寶馬私家車駛至橫頭磡邨對開富強街時，未有在斑馬線停車讓途人過路，其間東九龍交通部警員發現，於是尾隨跟蹤，準備在適當位置將之截停調查並作出票控。詎料寶馬沿途加速逃走，擺脫交通警員追截，最後馳至鳳德道近雙鳳街，司機棄車逃去。</p><p>其後人員到場發現涉事寶馬，並搜查車輛，一度派出緝毒犬協助，結果在車上檢獲約90粒依托咪酯。警方將案件列作販毒，正追緝在逃司機。消息稱，警方事後聯絡寶馬車主，但車主聲稱身處外地，並沒有借出車輛。</p><img alt=\"警方最終發現白色寶馬，檢獲毒品。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1972525eb2842a814672279d6d63e8c4/2026-11/11_3.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a4c4199f68a766133e2c788ada3cab56/2026-11/10_0_1.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在鳳德道近雙鳳街發現涉事寶馬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bec0f38e30457132a8bb5384b73548c1/2026-11/8_1_4.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0bf501b10dbff467d2988056d1bb147a/2026-11/5_12.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"寶馬未有停斑馬線讓途人過路，遇警方追截。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/78aae3b770203a70be3a154a327e1705/2026-11/4_11.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4f1a2113384fd3cb953c490a79cd89ff/2026-11/3_0_12.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2fa188b4ba1a0e0a1043fc97dc7b9fe4/2026-11/2_10.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a470dbaba09245688c1091d3ead363c9/2026-11/1_1_17.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2563e32ae44857d78a4f886f84bf69ed/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_51_18.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9e665e9f8eb3b610478e0b911731afd7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_51_16_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0bcd3ba5578bbd573cfddac5c643f59b/2026-11/7_1.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2d4147fce6250619c867b59fdf2cd1ce/2026-11/6_1.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方在寶馬車上檢獲約90粒依托咪酯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/62c8d25d1bdc95e5a2f8d58a08bb96a0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_51_16_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/63229cd3586c32f119f4256ef9bf2df5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_51_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"人員檢走證物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/48250ee70d641b35975ceea29ee2e2c9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_51_15.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/07d4abe12c1b57a21413ba56af3fc710/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_51_14_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a0cd42ca17e0966f43182af526cc9ba9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_51_12_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/094fe7865373279ffd88223a7cfe89c3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_51_12.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c7c7c9e8b1377638d82fc938824e28a7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_51_11_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:54:09.548575+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":20,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:35:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:28:38.298519+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:29.661650+00:00","content_hash":"d0971cd592cb7fd6482cf8983b0adf8d06a0924c5ae37617421bd48ab57378de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}